# Kind $66's arms (84:839E Kind66Start) that no play reaches, on stage a1
# s1 with the view and Aladdin put as cov_kind66_second.box puts them:
# the lift ($07 4, record $11EB), the rise platform ($07 2, $10FB) and
# the gates ($07 $0A and $0B, $10AB and $119B).
# 1. The lift is put at y $0158, Aladdin's test point (his x and y, $0640,
#    $0198) inside its zone $78: it takes him (his code PlayerSwitchHang),
#    carries him down and signals the rise platform, which rises and waits.
#    150 frames on DOWN lets him drop: the lift signals 0, goes back up
#    and pauses (K66_PAUSE). The rise platform comes back; 65 frames after
#    the drop, on its way back, its K66_GO ($113F) is set to 1: it waits
#    $18 frames and rises again.
# 2. Restarted (state $0C) from the same frames: $10AB with $07 1 (the
#    short swing, 152 frames of it, with Kind66Wobble's steps), $11EB with
#    $07 $10 (kind $6C's holder), and the gate $119B with its K66_PARENT
#    ($11E4) naming the free record $097B: it ends at once.
# 3. The rise platform alone, Aladdin left on the lift: its K66_GO set to
#    1 for 200 frames (it rises half a pixel a frame and waits at its
#    top), then 0: it waits $38 frames and comes back to where it started
#    (in pass 1 Aladdin walks off after his drop and the platform is ended
#    out of range before it is back).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,06
poke 0019E5 00,06
poke 001777 80,01
poke 0019E9 80,01
poke 0008E7 40,06
poke 0008EA A0,01
wait 40
poke 0011FA 58,01
wait 150
hold DOWN 4
wait 65
poke 00113F 01
wait 30
poke 00113F 00
wait 30
dump z1
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,06
poke 0019E5 00,06
poke 001777 80,01
poke 0019E9 80,01
poke 0008E7 40,06
poke 0008EA A0,01
wait 40
poke 0010B2 01
poke 0010AB 0C
poke 0011F2 10
poke 0011EB 0C
poke 0011E4 7B,09
poke 00119B 0C
wait 170
dump z2
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 00,06
poke 0019E5 00,06
poke 001777 80,01
poke 0019E9 80,01
poke 0008E7 40,06
poke 0008EA A0,01
wait 40
poke 00113F 01
wait 200
poke 00113F 00
wait 200
dump z3
